return ['messages'=>['"Como emisores de tarjetas y desarrolladores de plataforma propia, nos enfocamos en el desarrollo de soluciones que respondan a las necesidades y tendencias de nuestros clientes y en el desarrollo de nuevas soluciones para el mercado. El apoyo de Evertec ha sido fundamental para que estas innovaciones se lancen con la rapidez y seguridad necesarias", señala Antonio Rodrigues de Faria, Vicepresidente de Vólus.'=>'"As card issuers and developers of our own platform, we focus on building solutions that meet our clients\' needs and keep pace with market trends. Evertec\'s support has been essential in allowing these innovations to be brought to market with the speed and security they require," says Antonio Rodrigues de Faria, Vice President of Vólus.','"Mejoramos significativamente la experiencia del usuario, especialmente en viajes y desplazamientos corporativos. Sectores como agronegocios, transporte y logística se han beneficiado enormemente, ya que trabajan con equipos en constante movimiento y altos volúmenes de gastos", afirma Antonio de Faria, Vicepresidente de Vólus.'=>'"We significantly improved the user experience, especially for corporate travel and mobility. Sectors like agribusiness, transportation, and logistics have benefited greatly, as they deal with teams that are constantly on the move and handle high volumes of expenses," says Antonio de Faria, Vice President of Vólus.','442358c9d5322a0a093f6b1dd5a5c16b'=>'"As card issuers and developers of our own platform, we focus on building solutions that meet our clients\' needs and keep pace with market trends. Evertec\'s support has been essential in allowing these innovations to be brought to market with the speed and security they require," says Antonio Rodrigues de Faria, Vice President of Vólus.','4c97a7838e4ce27ae2252296c82006d5'=>'The results of this partnership translated into consistent growth: 130% in 2023, 70% in 2024, and 45% in 2025 — figures that reflect not only expansion, but the consolidation of Vólus solutions across sectors such as agribusiness, transportation, and logistics, where teams are constantly on the move and require tight control over corporate expenses.','90d66c3beff149640b9362a69035421e'=>'The partnership also drove the modernization of the Vólus user experience: virtual card issuance grew by over 200%, and today more than 70% of transactions are contactless — whether via physical card or digital wallet — a direct result of the infrastructure built with Evertec.','931fae98167c4d2309d0d0b07a935fb2'=>'Founded in 2000 in Rio Verde, Goiás, Vólus has expanded its portfolio over the years to include prepaid, postpaid, and debit cards within the open arrangement of the Elo network, as well as platforms for benefits, expense, and fleet management. With Evertec as a strategic partner, the company has strengthened its ability to serve businesses across different sectors with broader card acceptance, financial control, and compliance.','96f1fec84470f2d5a69ad513345913b6'=>'Since 2020, Evertec has supported Vólus across its entire payment flow — from physical and virtual card issuance, transaction authorization and reconciliation, to digital wallet integrations such as Google Pay and the implementation of security protocols like 3DS. This technological foundation enabled Vólus to launch innovations quickly and scale with confidence.','<em>La alianza triplicó la emisión de tarjetas virtuales y permitió integraciones con billeteras digitales</em>'=>'<em>The partnership tripled virtual card issuance and enabled integrations with digital wallets</em>','Conozca la solución de BIN Sponsor de Evertec y descubra cómo podemos estructurar la infraestructura de pagos de su negocio. <a href="/solucion/bin-sponsor/"><strong>Conozca BIN Sponsor</strong></a>'=>'Discover Evertec\'s BIN Sponsor solution and find out how we can build the payment infrastructure your business needs. <a href="https://evertecinc-com.plataformasegura.nubity.com/en/solution/bin-sponsor/"><strong>Explore BIN Sponsor</strong></a>','Cuando Vólus decidió escalar su operación nacional de tarjetas corporativas, encontró en Evertec Brasil el socio tecnológico para hacer posible ese crecimiento. A lo largo de cinco años, la colaboración movilizó R$ 500 millones en Viajes y Gastos Corporativos y resultó en un crecimiento total del 263% en el volumen de operaciones.'=>'When Vólus set out to scale its national corporate card operations, it found in Evertec Brasil the technology partner to make that growth possible. Over five years, the collaboration processed R$500 million in Corporate Travel and Expense transactions, resulting in a total growth of 263% in transaction volume.','Desde 2020, Evertec pasó a respaldar todo el flujo de pagos de Vólus — desde la emisión de tarjetas físicas y virtuales, autorización y conciliación de transacciones, hasta la integración con billeteras digitales como Google Pay y la adopción de protocolos de seguridad como 3DS. Esta base tecnológica fue la que le permitió a Vólus lanzar innovaciones con agilidad y escalar con seguridad.'=>'Since 2020, Evertec has supported Vólus across its entire payment flow — from physical and virtual card issuance, transaction authorization and reconciliation, to digital wallet integrations such as Google Pay and the implementation of security protocols like 3DS. This technological foundation enabled Vólus to launch innovations quickly and scale with confidence.','Fundada en el año 2000, en Rio Verde (GO), Vólus amplió a lo largo de los años su portafolio de tarjetas prepago, pospago y débito dentro del esquema abierto de la marca Elo, además de plataformas de gestión de beneficios, gastos y flotas. Con Evertec como socio estratégico, la empresa fortaleció su capacidad de atender a empresas de distintos segmentos con mayor aceptación, control financiero y cumplimiento normativo.'=>'Founded in 2000 in Rio Verde, Goiás, Vólus has expanded its portfolio over the years to include prepaid, postpaid, and debit cards within the open arrangement of the Elo network, as well as platforms for benefits, expense, and fleet management. With Evertec as a strategic partner, the company has strengthened its ability to serve businesses across different sectors with broader card acceptance, financial control, and compliance.','La alianza también aceleró la modernización de la experiencia de los usuarios de Vólus: la emisión de tarjetas virtuales creció más de 200% y, hoy, más del 70% de las transacciones se realizan por aproximación — ya sea con tarjeta física o mediante billeteras digitales —, reflejo directo de la infraestructura construida con Evertec.'=>'The partnership also drove the modernization of the Vólus user experience: virtual card issuance grew by over 200%, and today more than 70% of transactions are contactless — whether via physical card or digital wallet — a direct result of the infrastructure built with Evertec.','Los resultados de esta alianza se tradujeron en un crecimiento sostenido: 130% en 2023, 70% en 2024 y 45% en 2025 — cifras que reflejan no solo expansión, sino la consolidación de las soluciones de Vólus en sectores como agronegocios, transporte y logística, donde equipos en constante movimiento exigen un alto control sobre los gastos corporativos.'=>'The results of this partnership translated into consistent growth: 130% in 2023, 70% in 2024, and 45% in 2025 — figures that reflect not only expansion, but the consolidation of Vólus solutions across sectors such as agribusiness, transportation, and logistics, where teams are constantly on the move and require tight control over corporate expenses.','a25aebd14a190e32b6fe36386b659f2a'=>'"We significantly improved the user experience, especially for corporate travel and mobility. Sectors like agribusiness, transportation, and logistics have benefited greatly, as they deal with teams that are constantly on the move and handle high volumes of expenses," says Antonio de Faria, Vice President of Vólus.','efba323cce74daca91acb0670666e56d'=>'When Vólus set out to scale its national corporate card operations, it found in Evertec Brasil the technology partner to make that growth possible. Over five years, the collaboration processed R$500 million in Corporate Travel and Expense transactions, resulting in a total growth of 263% in transaction volume.','f34cb651c5b4c9b01500f086e6b2c2a6'=>'<em>The partnership tripled virtual card issuance and enabled integrations with digital wallets</em>','fb4087f7fae811ba0b006211b905f0a9'=>'Discover Evertec\'s BIN Sponsor solution and find out how we can build the payment infrastructure your business needs. <a href="https://evertecinc-com.plataformasegura.nubity.com/en/solution/bin-sponsor/"><strong>Explore BIN Sponsor</strong></a>']];
